{"seq":1,"slug":"cohort-studies","title":"队列研究","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/study-design/cohort-studies","wordCount":1790,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"队列研究\">队列研究</h1><p>要知道高血压会不会增加中风风险，最朴素的办法是找一群人，分成有高血压和无高血压两队，跟着他们往后走，看谁先中风。这就是队列研究——按暴露分组，向前追踪结局。它的逻辑顺着时间箭头走，因此天然满足因果推断里那条不可或缺的时序性，是观察性研究里最接近随机试验的设计。著名的弗雷明汉心脏研究从 1948 年随访至今，几乎所有「心血管危险因素」的概念都源于这类长期队列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>队列研究的骨架是「先确定暴露、后观察结局」。研究开始时所有人都还没出现目标结局，按是否暴露分成暴露组与非暴露组，随访一段时间，比较两组结局的发病频率。因为暴露状态在结局之前就已确定，时序性得到保证，这是它相对病例对照研究最大的优势。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[确定无结局人群] --&gt; B{按暴露分组}&#10;    B --&gt;|暴露组| C[随访发病情况]&#10;    B --&gt;|非暴露组| D[随访发病情况]&#10;    C --&gt; E[暴露组发病率 Ie]&#10;    D --&gt; F[非暴露组发病率 I0]&#10;    E --&gt; G[计算 RR=Ie/I0]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[关联强度与因果判断]\">flowchart TD\n    A[确定无结局人群] --&gt; B{按暴露分组}\n    B --&gt;|暴露组| C[随访发病情况]\n    B --&gt;|非暴露组| D[随访发病情况]\n    C --&gt; E[暴露组发病率 Ie]\n    D --&gt; F[非暴露组发病率 I0]\n    E --&gt; G[计算 RR=Ie/I0]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[关联强度与因果判断]</pre><p>队列研究按随访方向分两类，下表对照它们的时间结构与适用场景。这一区分常被初学者误解为「设计不同」，其实只是研究者站在时间轴的哪一点回看或前望。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>暴露与结局相对研究开始</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前瞻性队列</td>\n<td>暴露已定、结局未发生</td>\n<td>新收集随访</td>\n<td>暴露测量准、可控</td>\n<td>耗时长、费用高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回顾性队列</td>\n<td>暴露与结局均已发生</td>\n<td>历史档案</td>\n<td>快、省、适合罕见暴露</td>\n<td>受历史记录质量限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双向队列</td>\n<td>兼有</td>\n<td>档案+前瞻随访</td>\n<td>兼顾两者</td>\n<td>设计复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关联度量-rr-ar-与-par\">关联度量：RR、AR 与 PAR</h2><p>队列研究能直接计算两组的发病率，因此关联度量比病例对照丰富得多。最常用的相对危险度是两组发病率之比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR = \\dfrac{I_e}{I_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。若暴露组发病率 8%、非暴露组 2%，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.08</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>0.02</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR = 0.08/0.02 = 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.08/0.02</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>，意为暴露者发病风险是非暴露者的 4 倍。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 度量关联的强度，是 <a href=\"../foundations/causal-inference\">因果推断框架</a> 中 Hill「关联强度」准则的主要载体。</p>\n<p>但强度不等于公共卫生影响。归因危险度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AR = I_e - I_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量暴露者中「多出来」、可归因于暴露的绝对发病量；上例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AR = 8\\% - 2\\% = 6\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6%</span></span></span></span></span>，意为每 100 名暴露者中有 6 例是暴露造成的。进一步，归因危险度百分比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AR\\% = \\dfrac{I_e - I_0}{I_e} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span> 回答「暴露者的病有多大比例怪暴露」。站在整个人群角度，人群归因危险度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PAR = I_{total} - I_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PAR\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span></span></span></span></span> 则回答「若消除该暴露，全人群发病能降多少」，这是制定公共卫生政策时最关心的量——它既取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，也取决于人群中暴露的普遍程度。一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 不大但极普遍的暴露（如轻度高血压），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PAR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 可能远超一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 很大但罕见的暴露。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失访-人时与生存分析\">失访、人时与生存分析</h2><p>队列研究的阿喀琉斯之踵是失访。随访越长，搬家、退出、死于他因的人越多。如果失访与暴露和结局都无关，只是损失样本量；可一旦失访本身和结局相关（病重者更易退出），就引入了选择偏倚，详见 <a href=\"../bias-effects/bias-confounding\">偏倚与混杂</a>。一般以失访率是否超过 20% 作为警戒线，并需比较失访者与留存者的基线特征来评估方向。</p>\n<p>处理不齐整的随访，标准做法是用人时作分母计算发病密度，而非用人数算累积发病率，这一区分见 <a href=\"../foundations/disease-frequency\">疾病频率测量</a>。当不仅关心「是否发病」还关心「多久后发病」时，生存分析登场：Kaplan–Meier 曲线描绘随时间推移的无事件生存概率，Cox 比例风险模型则给出风险比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，在调整协变量的同时利用了每个人的精确随访时长。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 概念相近但建立在瞬时风险（hazard）上，是现代队列分析的主力工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"设计要点与现代变体\">设计要点与现代变体</h2><p>一个可信的队列研究，设计阶段要把几件事钉死。暴露的测量要尽量客观、可重复，最好在结局发生前就采集，避免回忆污染。结局的判定要有统一、盲法的诊断标准，理想情况下判定者不知道对象的暴露状态，以防信息偏倚。基线要充分采集潜在混杂因素，否则分析阶段无从调整——这与 <a href=\"../foundations/causal-inference\">因果推断框架</a> 中「需测全后门变量」的要求一脉相承。</p>\n<p>现代队列研究在传统设计上衍生出高效变体。巢式病例对照研究和病例队列研究，在大队列内部对发生结局的人和抽样的对照做昂贵的生物标志物检测，既保留队列的时序性，又省下全员检测的成本。利用电子健康档案与医保数据库构建的「数字队列」规模可达数百万，但代价是数据为诊疗而非研究采集，混杂和测量误差更难控制。正因如此，2020 年代兴起的目标试验模拟（见 <a href=\"../foundations/causal-inference\">因果推断框架</a>）几乎都以这类大型观察队列为载体，把队列研究往「显式逼近随机试验」的方向推进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优势-局限与适用边界\">优势、局限与适用边界</h2><p>把队列研究放回设计谱系，它的位置很清楚。下表对照三类常见情形，帮助判断何时该选队列、何时该让位给 <a href=\"case-control\">病例对照研究</a> 或 <a href=\"cross-sectional-ecological\">横断面与生态研究</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>队列研究表现</th>\n<th>更优选择</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>罕见结局</td>\n<td>差，需巨大样本与长随访</td>\n<td>病例对照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>罕见暴露</td>\n<td>好（可定向纳入暴露者）</td>\n<td>队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一因多果</td>\n<td>好（同时观察多种结局）</td>\n<td>队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>急需结果/经费有限</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>横断面或病例对照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要直接算发病率</td>\n<td>好（唯一能直接算）</td>\n<td>队列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话概括：队列研究以时序性和可直接计算发病率为长，以耗时、昂贵、不适合罕见结局为短。当暴露罕见、需同时研究多种结局、且能承受时间与经费成本时，它是观察性研究里证据等级最高的设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>队列研究「先定暴露、后观结局」，天然满足时序性，是最接近随机试验的观察设计。</li>\n<li>可直接计算发病率，故能给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>（强度）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AR\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span></span></span></span></span>（个体绝对影响）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PAR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PAR\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span></span></span></span></span>（人群层面可消除的发病）。</li>\n<li>失访是核心威胁，超 20% 需警惕选择偏倚；随访不齐用人时与发病密度，关注发病时间则用生存分析（KM、Cox <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>设计要点是暴露客观前测、结局盲法判定、基线充分采集混杂；巢式与数字队列是高效现代变体。</li>\n<li>适合罕见暴露与一因多果，不适合罕见结局与急需结果的场景，是观察研究中证据等级最高者。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"队列研究","id":"队列研究"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"关联度量：RR、AR 与 PAR","id":"关联度量-rr-ar-与-par"},{"level":2,"text":"失访、人时与生存分析","id":"失访-人时与生存分析"},{"level":2,"text":"设计要点与现代变体","id":"设计要点与现代变体"},{"level":2,"text":"优势、局限与适用边界","id":"优势-局限与适用边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"因果推断框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/foundations/causal-inference"},"next":{"title":"病例对照研究","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/epidemiology-basics/study-design/case-control"}}